/*
 * Declares the UseAliasSymbol class.
 *
 * UseAliasSymbol is the scope a named `use` binds its resolved modules to. It
 * holds no declaration of its own: everything reached through it comes from the
 * modules the `use` resolved to, which are stored as if the scope had used them.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::symbol::use_alias
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/symbol/use_alias.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-09-09
